yle=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 당해학기에 교내에서 수행하고 있는 </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">타 사업의 멘토 또는 유사한 사업에 참여하거나, </span></p><p class=\"본문(동그라미)\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">교내 교육조교 장학금을 수혜한 자 또는 수혜 예정자는 중복 참여 불가 </span></p><p class=\"본문(동그라미)\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 학기 초과자 및 튜터는 외국인유학생 참여 불가</span></span></span></p><p class=\"본문(동그라미)\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 운영시간 : 40시간 이상</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"큰제목\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◎</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;신청기간 및 신청방법 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">: </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">신청기간내 해당 학부(과)행정실로 서류 제출</span></p><p class=\"본문(동그라미)\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SI